{"text": " I love this video. I usually spend my holidays here in New York and New York just feels universally nostalgic during holidays. And it's small things like right now you can't tell, but it's snowing outside and in a warm apartment I have a nice cold Coca-Cola which as a kid I always associate with snow and a polar bear so it feels very nostalgic like I'm in an old Christmas TV movie. New York just has this way of making the holidays feel magical no matter how you choose to spend them. Speaking of holiday magic I think Coca-Cola did an amazing job with capturing that feeling with curling all the way on Coca-Cola where they went into neighborhoods, they surprised them with music, they surprised them with joy with those little moments that really bring your community together. It just reminded me of why I love this season so much. So if you want to get in the spirit as well I highly recommend you check out that video as such a feel good watch and really brings that holiday energy to life.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.16, "text": " I love this video.", "tokens": [50364, 286, 959, 341, 960, 13, 50572], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2706082013188576, "compression_ratio": 1.5802469135802468, "no_speech_prob": 0.0817011371254921}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 4.16, "end": 10.0, "text": " I usually spend my holidays here in New York and New York just feels universally nostalgic during", "tokens": [50572, 286, 2673, 3496, 452, 15734, 510, 294, 1873, 3609, 293, 1873, 3609, 445, 3417, 43995, 40240, 1830, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2706082013188576, "compression_ratio": 1.5802469135802468, "no_speech_prob": 0.0817011371254921}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 10.0, "end": 11.0, "text": " holidays.", "tokens": [50864, 15734, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2706082013188576, "compression_ratio": 1.5802469135802468, "no_speech_prob": 0.0817011371254921}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 11.0, "end": 15.